I petition the Attorney General for a Public Records Order under ORS 192.41=
1, ORS 192.324(6), and ORS 192.407. The public body is the Oregon State Pol=
ice, Central Records Section. The request is PR27478, submitted April 3, 20=
26, concerning OSP CAD event SP26097765.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
In brief: OSP issued a &quot;no records&quot; determination on April 3, 202=
6. Ten days later a responsive CAD record was printed inside its Central Re=
cords Section; it was produced to me on July 14, 2026 =97 in full, with no =
exemption claimed and no fee charged =97 after
 being conditioned for three months on a $12.50 payment and a mailed paper =
form. One hundred and ten days after the request, five of the requested cat=
egories remain without any disposition, no exemption has been cited for any=
thing, the search has never been
 described, the fee waiver has never been ruled on, and the litigation pres=
ervation notice I served on April 2, 2026 has never been acknowledged.</div=
>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
<br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
system, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(3=
3, 33, 33);">
The attached petition sets out the record in full and states the relief req=
uested. The exhibits (1=9625) are the complete correspondence and the produ=
ced record, in a single indexed and page-labeled PDF; the exhibit index app=
ears in Section VII of the petition.
 I am not asking the Attorney General to make any finding about the underly=
ing event =97 only to require Oregon State Police to respond to a public re=
cords request as the statute requires.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_MSFontService, -apple-=
